  m_text: 'YOU ESCAPED.

    

    

    But the world is still frozen...

    

    

    

    Thanks
    for playing LifeGame.

    

    

    

    Created by:

    Spinel

    

    

    

    First
    Unity Prototype

    Made with Unity 6

    

    

    

    Features:

    -
    Top Down Movement

    - Blend Tree Animations

    - Key & Door System

    -
    Scene Transition

    - Ending Screen

    

    

    

    Assets Credits

    

    

    UI:

    toffeecraft.itch.io/ui

    

    Key:

    drxwat.itch.io/pixel-art-key

    

    Character:

    immunitys.itch.io/pixel-top-down-character

    

    Fantasy
    Pack:

    oddpotatodev.itch.io/16x16-fantasy-pack

    

    Environment:

    cupnooble.itch.io/sprout-lands-asset-pack

    

    Sky
    Background:

    free-game-assets.itch.io/free-sky-with-clouds-background-pixel-art-set

    

    

    

    Special
    Thanks:

    Unity

    GitHub

    Coffee

    And motivation at 2AM.

    

    

    

    THE
    END'
